@signupUrl = http://signup.localhost:8080
@sandboxUrl = http://helping-hands.sandbox.localhost:8080
@opsUrl = http://ops.localhost:8080
@tenantToken = REPLACE_WITH_TENANT_ADMIN_BEARER_TOKEN
@domainId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@tenantId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 1. Provision a new Sandbox workspace for an IRS-recognized 501(c)(3) charity
POST {{signupUrl}}/api/v1/platform/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "legalName": "Helping Hands Community Relief Inc",
  "displayName": "Helping Hands",
  "slug": "helping-hands",
  "ein": "52-1234567",
  "irsSubsectionCode": "501(c)(3)",
  "stateCode": "MD",
  "timeZoneId": "America/New_York",
  "primaryBranchName": "Baltimore Center",
  "adminUserName": "orgadmin",
  "adminEmail": "ops@helpinghands.org",
  "adminDisplayName": "Relief Director",
  "adminPassword": "TaxExemptStrong#2026!"
}

### 2. Negative test: Reject non-exempt 501(c)(7) social club on signup
POST {{signupUrl}}/api/v1/platform/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "legalName": "Downtown Social Club",
  "displayName": "Social Club",
  "slug": "downtown-club",
  "ein": "52-9876543",
  "irsSubsectionCode": "501(c)(7)",
  "stateCode": "VA",
  "timeZoneId": "America/New_York",
  "primaryBranchName": "Clubhouse",
  "adminUserName": "clubadmin",
  "adminEmail": "admin@club.org",
  "adminDisplayName": "Club Admin",
  "adminPassword": "TaxExemptStrong#2026!"
}

### 3. Get current organization compliance, IRS EO BMF, Stripe Connect, and domain status
GET {{sandboxUrl}}/api/v1/tenancy/compliance
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### 4. Start or resume Stripe Connect Express onboarding session
POST {{sandboxUrl}}/api/v1/tenancy/stripe-connect/onboarding
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "returnUrl": "/admin/compliance",
  "refreshUrl": "/admin/compliance"
}

### 5. Complete simulated Stripe Connect payout readiness (when Tenancy:StripeMockMode=true)
POST {{sandboxUrl}}/api/v1/tenancy/stripe-connect/mock-complete
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 6. Register an organization-owned custom domain (returns 201 Created + DNS TXT challenge)
POST {{sandboxUrl}}/api/v1/tenancy/domains
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hostname": "giving.helpinghands.org",
  "makePrimaryWhenVerified": true
}

### 7. Verify DNS TXT ownership for a registered custom domain
POST {{sandboxUrl}}/api/v1/tenancy/domains/{{domainId}}/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "observedTxtToken": "domain-verify-00000000000000000000000000000000"
}

### 8. Run IRS EO BMF verification and submit workspace for Platform Operator Go-Live approval
POST {{sandboxUrl}}/api/v1/tenancy/go-live/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 9. Authenticate as a Platform Operator on the isolated operator host
POST {{opsUrl}}/api/v1/platform/operators/authenticate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "compliance@ops.localhost",
  "password": "OperatorPass!2026#"
}

### 10. List organization tenants awaiting Go-Live verification
GET {{opsUrl}}/api/v1/platform/operators/queue?stage=PendingVerification

### 11. Approve a verified tax-exempt tenant for Live operations
POST {{opsUrl}}/api/v1/platform/operators/review
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetTenantId": "{{tenantId}}",
  "decision": "ApproveLive",
  "notes": "Verified active 501(c)(3) status in IRS EO BMF.",
  "manualIrsOverrideApproved": false
}

### 12. Sign out of the Platform Operator session
POST {{opsUrl}}/api/v1/platform/operators/logout
